+# shader
+
+## add Functional
+
+- [Per-stage loop limits](../../../core/shader/recompiler/LoopGuard.hpp) (shader recompiler) - `APS5_LOOP_GUARD=stages` stops loops after 128 iterations per entry in pixel programs, 256 in vertex, tessellation and mesh programs and 4096 in compute programs, and `APS5_LOOP_GUARD_<PIXEL|VERTEX|MESH|COMPUTE>` override one stage. The defaults are what another translation layer needed for one title to keep the GPU from hanging, not limits the console has: a console loop that runs longer is cut short (the `LoopLimit` fault reports it), and the limits were not measured against other titles.
